/**CFile****************************************************************

  FileName    [abcMap.c]

  SystemName  [ABC: Logic synthesis and verification system.]

  PackageName [Network and node package.]

  Synopsis    [Interface with the SC mapping package.]

  Author      [Alan Mishchenko]
  
  Affiliation [UC Berkeley]

